/-!
# The same eight reflection on every centered supported path

The actual Cartan apartment is a nonbranching line. At either marked vertex,
the supplied reflection interchanges its two apartment neighbors and therefore
reverses every centered supported twelve-path, in either orientation.

At the eight endpoint, the two half-roots lie in the prescribed full-core
complement generated by the original six-root and reflection. Their actual
local quotient is onto; faithfulness of the same complement identifies the
two groups. Thus the original reflection itself belongs to every such actor.
-/

public noncomputable section
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
open Subgroup Theory.GroupTheory RankTwoAmalgam SimpleGraph SimpleGraph.Walk
open Subgroup.CosetGeometry Theory.GroupTheory.WeakBNPair.RegularTree
